body:
The widget have to enforce a default value like `pagination` does otherwise its value is controlled by its parent. With the following setup (see below), a change inside `pagination` also update `infiniteHits` which is not expected.

```js
search.addWidgets([
  pagination(), 
  index.addWidgets([
    infiniteHits(),
  ])
]);
```

